HealerMinigame
==============

This project is a standalone extraction of the healer revive minigame from
CivLabs' MiniEvents plugins. The minigame logic (the injury/healthy-item revive
inventory, click handling, and progress bar) originated from CivLabs and was
adapted here into a self-contained training minigame with timing and a
leaderboard. Only how the minigame is accessed was changed; its mechanics are
unchanged from the original.

Original source (CivLabs):
  https://github.com/Emergent-Civilization/MiniEvents-Specialization

All credit for the original minigame goes to CivLabs.
